31,1,1,talk,Kenji,,Good morning! I hope everyone slept well. Any thoughts on who the wolf might be?,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"I have some information. Sakura, you are the werewolf.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"That was a very direct start. @Victoria, are you the Seer?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,George,,"It seems a bit sudden to accuse a child so quickly, doesn't it?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"What?! No way! Victoria, you're lying! I'm just a normal girl!","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"Whoa, Victoria is the Seer? If she's telling the truth, we found the wolf already!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"Yes, I am the Seer. My divination was clear. Sakura is the werewolf.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"If Victoria is the werewolf and lying about being the Seer, she'd want to eliminate Sakura.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,George,,That is a possibility. We should consider if this is a bluff to gain trust.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Sakura,,See! George is right! Victoria is the mean one! I'm not a wolf!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""George"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"But Victoria seems so sure. @Victoria, why Sakura?","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Victoria,,Because the divination told me so. There is no room for doubt in the result.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@George, you seem very quick to defend Sakura. That's interesting.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""George"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,George,,I simply believe in fairness. We shouldn't execute someone based on one claim without thought.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"Thank you, George! You're the best!","{""words"":6,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Kenji,,I trust Victoria. She's been very calm and rational. I'll vote for Sakura.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Victoria,,"The truth is evident. Please, let us act now before more of us are killed.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I'll follow the Seer's lead for now. It's the most logical path.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,George,,"I still have my doubts, but if the majority agrees, I cannot stop it.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Sakura,,No! This is unfair! I'm innocent!,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
